(3714392, 524139, 76184, '<td valign="top">hubba hubba.<br/> <br/>My science teacher in 9th grade didn''t looks like this. She had hairy legs like a man and insisted on wearing skirts. Uck.<br/> <br/>Aside from the pretty girl with excellent cleavage, this is a decent studio shot. The bits and pieces on the left side are borderline clutter, but are needed to make the challenge, I think. I think this is a good idea, but it is the beginning of an idea and still had room for refinement.<br/> <br/>7</td>', 'hubba hubba. My science teacher in 9th grade didn''t looks like this. She had hairy legs like a man and insisted on wearing skirts. Uck. Aside from the pretty girl with excellent cleavage, this is a decent studio shot. The bits and pieces on the left side are borderline clutter, but are needed to make the challenge, I think. I think this is a good idea, but it is the beginning of an idea and still had room for refinement. 7', '2007-05-30 13:09:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3714421, 521484, 76184, '<td valign="top">Good depth of field. I don''t mind the cropping of the boy''s face, but I would like to have seen both hands and the whole chunk of crystal.<br/>Overall contrast seems bit low, too, but that is only a minor bit.<br/>Should score well enough as it is, though. 8</td>', 'Good depth of field. I don''t mind the cropping of the boy''s face, but I would like to have seen both hands and the whole chunk of crystal.Overall contrast seems bit low, too, but that is only a minor bit.Should score well enough as it is, though. 8', '2007-05-30 13:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
