(3716381, 523512, 66267, '<td valign="top">hehe i thought of this idea too... you can see the string a bit, and the apple doesn''t at all look like it''s falling, but i like your editing.</td>', 'hehe i thought of this idea too... you can see the string a bit, and the apple doesn''t at all look like it''s falling, but i like your editing.', '2007-05-30 17:01:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3716385, 523617, 72774, '<td valign="top">Interesting, but I don''t like that the bottom is cut off -- poor composition I think.  Could also use some more color (saturation).  The sharpness is great though.</td>', 'Interesting, but I don''t like that the bottom is cut off -- poor composition I think.  Could also use some more color (saturation).  The sharpness is great though.', '2007-05-30 17:02:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3716391, 523742, 72774, '<td valign="top">Good job getting all of the web and the spider in focus.  Some of the background elements might be a bit distracting though.</td>', 'Good job getting all of the web and the spider in focus.  Some of the background elements might be a bit distracting though.', '2007-05-30 17:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3716396, 523795, 72774, '<td valign="top">Good image, although I''d like to see a different composition with the subject not centered (if it is possible with the way you shot it).</td>', 'Good image, although I''d like to see a different composition with the subject not centered (if it is possible with the way you shot it).', '2007-05-30 17:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3716397, 521456, 75171, '<td valign="top">a bit dark, but it softens the light...makes it nice and warm-i like it :)</td>', 'a bit dark, but it softens the light...makes it nice and warm-i like it :)', '2007-05-30 17:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3716404, 520591, 72774, '<td valign="top">Good color, but it suffers from a lack of focus in the center -- maybe more aggressive sharpening would help?</td>', 'Good color, but it suffers from a lack of focus in the center -- maybe more aggressive sharpening would help?', '2007-05-30 17:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3716407, 523105, 72774, '<td valign="top">This is cool, but I really want to see a tighter composition.  There''s a lot of empty space to the upper right which really doesn''t need to be there.<br/> <br/>Great capture though!</td>', 'This is cool, but I really want to see a tighter composition.  There''s a lot of empty space to the upper right which really doesn''t need to be there. Great capture though!', '2007-05-30 17:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3716415, 523439, 67152, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting and the set up except for the syringe - are you adding something with the syringe? or is this going to be used to pick the solids up?  I would think a drop coming out of the filled syringe would have been more dramatic (and more realistic).</td>', 'I like the lighting and the set up except for the syringe - are you adding something with the syringe? or is this going to be used to pick the solids up?  I would think a drop coming out of the filled syringe would have been more dramatic (and more realistic).', '2007-05-30 17:10:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3716423, 524139, 78388, '<td valign="top">Credit for going for the cheap vote! If only I''d had such a teacher in 9th grade!<br/> <br/>A reckon a wonder-bra would have got you somewhere between +1-2 points though!</td>', 'Credit for going for the cheap vote! If only I''d had such a teacher in 9th grade! A reckon a wonder-bra would have got you somewhere between +1-2 points though!', '2007-05-30 17:11:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3716449, 523456, 46119, '<td valign="top">I''m not too sure I see the connection to the challenge theme and the subject looks like her left arm is broken to me which is very distracting ...</td>', 'I''m not too sure I see the connection to the challenge theme and the subject looks like her left arm is broken to me which is very distracting ...', '2007-05-30 17:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3716467, 523512, 67152, '<td valign="top">Really nice set up and concept - your editing to remove the line from the apple could be a little better but it is still a nice job.</td>', 'Really nice set up and concept - your editing to remove the line from the apple could be a little better but it is still a nice job.', '2007-05-30 17:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3716471, 523709, 75898, '<td valign="top">"And then we sealed them in plastic bags and sold our experiments to these guys for a bunch of money!"  ...  I hope your picture is a drug-reference because if it''s not, then my comment makes no sense.</td>', '"And then we sealed them in plastic bags and sold our experiments to these guys for a bunch of money!"  ...  I hope your picture is a drug-reference because if it''s not, then my comment makes no sense.', '2007-05-30 17:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
