(3716713, 519824, 51793, '<td valign="top">yep it sure is. But where''s the science?<br/> <br/>After talking about it an a thread and understanding the whole idea behind the frog I have come back for a bump. <br/>BTW clearity is perfect. You really did a wonderful job taking this. There is some noise in the background but it''s okay really. Use the blur tool to get rid of that. Click and move click and move. haha, anyway Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'yep it sure is. But where''s the science? After talking about it an a thread and understanding the whole idea behind the frog I have come back for a bump. BTW clearity is perfect. You really did a wonderful job taking this. There is some noise in the background but it''s okay really. Use the blur tool to get rid of that. Click and move click and move. haha, anyway Good luck with the challenge.', '2007-05-30 18:41:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3716722, 523846, 76198, '<td valign="top">Wow, that''s super charming! He''s adorable, and the optical treatment, whatever it is (please tell us) is perfect.<br/> <br/>edit - I get it, I think - through the microscope! Awesome.</td>', 'Wow, that''s super charming! He''s adorable, and the optical treatment, whatever it is (please tell us) is perfect. edit - I get it, I think - through the microscope! Awesome.', '2007-05-30 18:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
