(3716773, 523010, 78115, '<td valign="top">great shot</td>', 'great shot', '2007-05-30 19:02:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3716776, 522548, 61651, '<td valign="top">Very cool nuclear history reference - kudos for going the extra mile for your challenge topic.</td>', 'Very cool nuclear history reference - kudos for going the extra mile for your challenge topic.', '2007-05-30 19:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3716842, 521683, 51793, '<td valign="top">I''m not real sure what this has to do with science but I''ll grade your photo. <br/> <br/>The DOF is great however the entire image looks like a straight from the camera shot. There is no real sharpness to the image and the colors don''t really pop out at me. The stick behind the bird is distracting and the image isn''t straight. Rule of Thirds needs to be applied here. This is an advanced editing challenge and you should take full advantage of that. <br/> <br/>Good luck with your entry.</td>', 'I''m not real sure what this has to do with science but I''ll grade your photo.  The DOF is great however the entire image looks like a straight from the camera shot. There is no real sharpness to the image and the colors don''t really pop out at me. The stick behind the bird is distracting and the image isn''t straight. Rule of Thirds needs to be applied here. This is an advanced editing challenge and you should take full advantage of that.  Good luck with your entry.', '2007-05-30 19:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3716849, 523532, 51793, '<td valign="top">I think there is way to much going on here. The fire effect is neat but other than that there is nothing real special about this picture. <br/>Good luck with you entry</td>', 'I think there is way to much going on here. The fire effect is neat but other than that there is nothing real special about this picture. Good luck with you entry', '2007-05-30 19:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
