(3719269, 524209, 52500, '<td valign="top">Great expressions on the kids.  I like the toning as well.</td>', 'Great expressions on the kids.  I like the toning as well.', '2007-05-31 13:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719273, 524139, 52500, '<td valign="top">Funny shot!  I think a more realistic looking classroom environment would help for me (mostly I don''t like the background - chalkboard or whiteboard would be better).  The vignette is a bit too much for me as well.</td>', 'Funny shot!  I think a more realistic looking classroom environment would help for me (mostly I don''t like the background - chalkboard or whiteboard would be better).  The vignette is a bit too much for me as well.', '2007-05-31 13:32:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719300, 522898, 52500, '<td valign="top">Drops of water on a CD is a rather cliché shot around here, and this one doesn''t really stand out to me.  It doesn''t really scream surface tension to me either.  The colors are pretty, though.  A solid 5.</td>', 'Drops of water on a CD is a rather cliché shot around here, and this one doesn''t really stand out to me.  It doesn''t really scream surface tension to me either.  The colors are pretty, though.  A solid 5.', '2007-05-31 13:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719317, 523886, 52500, '<td valign="top">Ah, the ol'' petri dish shot.  This is well done, but it doesn''t really grab my attention.</td>', 'Ah, the ol'' petri dish shot.  This is well done, but it doesn''t really grab my attention.', '2007-05-31 13:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719319, 523172, 52500, '<td valign="top">This is cool looking in general, but I''m not a fan of the noise/grain.</td>', 'This is cool looking in general, but I''m not a fan of the noise/grain.', '2007-05-31 13:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719329, 523746, 52500, '<td valign="top">The photo itself is well made, but it just feels like a gimmicky attempt to make a "photo of a thing" more interesting.  It does work to a certain extent. 5</td>', 'The photo itself is well made, but it just feels like a gimmicky attempt to make a "photo of a thing" more interesting.  It does work to a certain extent. 5', '2007-05-31 14:01:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719338, 520824, 52500, '<td valign="top">This screams technology to me...not so much science.  I don''t worry about those kind of things too much though.  I really like the high contrast treatment here, and the bits spilling out was a great idea.</td>', 'This screams technology to me...not so much science.  I don''t worry about those kind of things too much though.  I really like the high contrast treatment here, and the bits spilling out was a great idea.', '2007-05-31 14:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719346, 523174, 79128, '<td valign="top">Great use of colors</td>', 'Great use of colors', '2007-05-31 14:10:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719353, 523439, 52500, '<td valign="top">I think with this kind of shot, it needs to be really sharp for it to have any impact.  This looks like it is nicely focused, just not very sharp.  A touch of USM would help immensely.</td>', 'I think with this kind of shot, it needs to be really sharp for it to have any impact.  This looks like it is nicely focused, just not very sharp.  A touch of USM would help immensely.', '2007-05-31 14:13:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719354, 521110, 79128, '<td valign="top">Great shot! It almost looks like suspended in time and space.</td>', 'Great shot! It almost looks like suspended in time and space.', '2007-05-31 14:13:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719372, 521408, 65234, '<td valign="top">One of my favorite phrases ;-)</td>', 'One of my favorite phrases ;-)', '2007-05-31 14:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719373, 523537, 52500, '<td valign="top">I like the subject, but the photo itself doesn''t have much punch.  It feels like the rocket should either be lit well or a nice black silhouette.  Maybe try a shot with the sun setting behind you?</td>', 'I like the subject, but the photo itself doesn''t have much punch.  It feels like the rocket should either be lit well or a nice black silhouette.  Maybe try a shot with the sun setting behind you?', '2007-05-31 14:21:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719399, 523596, 52500, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty good zoo shot.  I like the expressions on the apes (or are they monkeys?), but I don''t like the background.</td>', 'This is a pretty good zoo shot.  I like the expressions on the apes (or are they monkeys?), but I don''t like the background.', '2007-05-31 14:30:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719405, 519838, 52500, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for optical physics, what can I say.  Nice colors and composition.  It does seem a bit over saturated, and there is some funky artifacting in the pinks and reds that is distracting.</td>', 'I''m a sucker for optical physics, what can I say.  Nice colors and composition.  It does seem a bit over saturated, and there is some funky artifacting in the pinks and reds that is distracting.', '2007-05-31 14:32:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719419, 523951, 52500, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot, but the processing brings it down a couple of points for me.  Drop the saturation down a ways, add some contrast and hit it with some noise reduction and sharpening and it''s a fantastic image (for me).</td>', 'This is a great shot, but the processing brings it down a couple of points for me.  Drop the saturation down a ways, add some contrast and hit it with some noise reduction and sharpening and it''s a fantastic image (for me).', '2007-05-31 14:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719437, 523504, 65234, '<td valign="top">Looks more ike a lab gerbil; hope it''s just a posing pet and not really stuck in a lab.  Nice composition.</td>', 'Looks more ike a lab gerbil; hope it''s just a posing pet and not really stuck in a lab.  Nice composition.', '2007-05-31 14:39:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719463, 524120, 52500, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea.  I like the composition and the rainbow effect, but the colors are way over saturated.</td>', 'Interesting idea.  I like the composition and the rainbow effect, but the colors are way over saturated.', '2007-05-31 14:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719470, 524106, 52500, '<td valign="top">Mmmmm....genetically engineered tomatoes.  I with the syringe/needle thing was a bit sharper.  Other than that, it looks good.</td>', 'Mmmmm....genetically engineered tomatoes.  I with the syringe/needle thing was a bit sharper.  Other than that, it looks good.', '2007-05-31 14:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719487, 522370, 52500, '<td valign="top">For me, this shot falls into the category of "I took a nice shot, let''s see if I can give it a title to fit the challenge."  Don''t worry, I did the exact same thing.  I am of the opinion that science is humanity''s quest for knowledge, and that exists all around us all of the time.  This is quite a lovely landscape.</td>', 'For me, this shot falls into the category of "I took a nice shot, let''s see if I can give it a title to fit the challenge."  Don''t worry, I did the exact same thing.  I am of the opinion that science is humanity''s quest for knowledge, and that exists all around us all of the time.  This is quite a lovely landscape.', '2007-05-31 14:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719491, 522876, 52500, '<td valign="top">Simple and elegant.  Nice use of thirds.</td>', 'Simple and elegant.  Nice use of thirds.', '2007-05-31 14:53:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719560, 521651, 63006, '<td valign="top">well that''s an odd one.. good points for the humor factor. i''m not sure that i like the graininess of the photo, but i suppose it works if you''re going for a space kind of look.</td>', 'well that''s an odd one.. good points for the humor factor. i''m not sure that i like the graininess of the photo, but i suppose it works if you''re going for a space kind of look.', '2007-05-31 15:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719565, 523468, 63006, '<td valign="top">i really like this one. the black border could be a little thinner in my opinion, or even in from the edges like i''ve seen some. however, as an artist i have to complain that you didn''t include all the primary colors. mostly it''s a joke, because i can see you can''t. original idea, and i overall like it a lot. 7</td>', 'i really like this one. the black border could be a little thinner in my opinion, or even in from the edges like i''ve seen some. however, as an artist i have to complain that you didn''t include all the primary colors. mostly it''s a joke, because i can see you can''t. original idea, and i overall like it a lot. 7', '2007-05-31 15:08:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719578, 523184, 63006, '<td valign="top">Well, as a shot i like it. the rainbow effect given by the polarizers is very good looking, and it adds interest to an otherwise kind of dreary photo of yet another mountain. (nothing against you here, it''s just that i''ve seen a lot of mountains) the spelling mistake in the title (wrong affect/effect) is a bit of a downer, but i do overall like the photo. one other thing i''m coming to see as i look at it is that the color overlay seems to detract from the focus and sharpness. overall, very well done, 7</td>', 'Well, as a shot i like it. the rainbow effect given by the polarizers is very good looking, and it adds interest to an otherwise kind of dreary photo of yet another mountain. (nothing against you here, it''s just that i''ve seen a lot of mountains) the spelling mistake in the title (wrong affect/effect) is a bit of a downer, but i do overall like the photo. one other thing i''m coming to see as i look at it is that the color overlay seems to detract from the focus and sharpness. overall, very well done, 7', '2007-05-31 15:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719587, 523407, 63006, '<td valign="top">whoohoo, magnesium? i like the shot, and the crop. the border you''ve included is wonderful, as it''s there as an afterthought, more than intruding into the picture. i think i would have liked to see it as just the blue line over the photo as the border, so the sparks could come through. the colors are bright, and your contrast is really well done. capitals in your title to make it consistent would have been good, but it''s still a good shot. 6</td>', 'whoohoo, magnesium? i like the shot, and the crop. the border you''ve included is wonderful, as it''s there as an afterthought, more than intruding into the picture. i think i would have liked to see it as just the blue line over the photo as the border, so the sparks could come through. the colors are bright, and your contrast is really well done. capitals in your title to make it consistent would have been good, but it''s still a good shot. 6', '2007-05-31 15:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719591, 519720, 63006, '<td valign="top">well, i don''t particularly like this a lot. it does remind me of a honey comb, in colors and shapes, but it is a very good and original idea. 5</td>', 'well, i don''t particularly like this a lot. it does remind me of a honey comb, in colors and shapes, but it is a very good and original idea. 5', '2007-05-31 15:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719594, 522903, 52500, '<td valign="top">Well this turned out pretty darn cool.  What the heck did you take a picture of, anyway?  A bit more contrast and sharpening would really make it pop.</td>', 'Well this turned out pretty darn cool.  What the heck did you take a picture of, anyway?  A bit more contrast and sharpening would really make it pop.', '2007-05-31 15:14:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719599, 522063, 63006, '<td valign="top">very interesting. the sticky liquids being at weird angles are throwing me off a bit as i look through the picture. the glasses and oversaturation in the hair are a very nice touch. good idea, 6</td>', 'very interesting. the sticky liquids being at weird angles are throwing me off a bit as i look through the picture. the glasses and oversaturation in the hair are a very nice touch. good idea, 6', '2007-05-31 15:15:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719602, 521456, 52500, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty good try at this effect.  The hand could be brighter, and the black edge around the end of the bulb is rather distracting.</td>', 'This is a pretty good try at this effect.  The hand could be brighter, and the black edge around the end of the bulb is rather distracting.', '2007-05-31 15:16:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719604, 523846, 42995, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot!</td>', 'Fantastic shot!', '2007-05-31 15:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719608, 523500, 63006, '<td valign="top">very nice shot and idea, i like the clean lines and focus. the fact that the doors are not even does not appeal to me, either that or if they''d been not in the photo at all. still, i like the idea a lot, as some of the pieces of the past are becoming much more popular in today''s world. 7</td>', 'very nice shot and idea, i like the clean lines and focus. the fact that the doors are not even does not appeal to me, either that or if they''d been not in the photo at all. still, i like the idea a lot, as some of the pieces of the past are becoming much more popular in today''s world. 7', '2007-05-31 15:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719622, 520615, 63006, '<td valign="top">very brightly colored photo, I like it. there seems to be too much grain in the blue areas though, maybe from too much saturation or over sharpening? i think i would have preferrred the crop being closer to the head too, as the dead space detracts. also the "x" branch by the beak distracts because it''s too bright. i don''t mean to be down on you, just trying to make some pointers. great capture though, looks as if the bird is listening to you talk. 5</td>', 'very brightly colored photo, I like it. there seems to be too much grain in the blue areas though, maybe from too much saturation or over sharpening? i think i would have preferrred the crop being closer to the head too, as the dead space detracts. also the "x" branch by the beak distracts because it''s too bright. i don''t mean to be down on you, just trying to make some pointers. great capture though, looks as if the bird is listening to you talk. 5', '2007-05-31 15:18:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719625, 523496, 63006, '<td valign="top">i like the capture and crop very much. the lack of lighting on the tail though kind of makes it fade into the background, which is something i''m not liking, as the rest of the subject is visible. great idea though, 6</td>', 'i like the capture and crop very much. the lack of lighting on the tail though kind of makes it fade into the background, which is something i''m not liking, as the rest of the subject is visible. great idea though, 6', '2007-05-31 15:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719627, 524034, 63006, '<td valign="top">i love the lines and focus here. the bright greens really draw me in, and the sharp black lines lead into a spiral. good job here, maybe some water droplets (cliche as they may be) would have been a good idea all over to add life.</td>', 'i love the lines and focus here. the bright greens really draw me in, and the sharp black lines lead into a spiral. good job here, maybe some water droplets (cliche as they may be) would have been a good idea all over to add life.', '2007-05-31 15:20:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719629, 520521, 63006, '<td valign="top">5</td>', '5', '2007-05-31 15:20:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719659, 523512, 63006, '<td valign="top">very nice shot, i like the spotlight effect on newton and his apples. the unfortunate thing about it, is that i can see the string that''s holding the apple. if i may suggest, hanging the apple at an angle may have been better, as it looks set up here. great idea and processing though :) 8</td>', 'very nice shot, i like the spotlight effect on newton and his apples. the unfortunate thing about it, is that i can see the string that''s holding the apple. if i may suggest, hanging the apple at an angle may have been better, as it looks set up here. great idea and processing though :) 8', '2007-05-31 15:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719666, 523548, 63006, '<td valign="top">i can''t immediately be sure, but is that a condom? interesting idea, but my guess is that others are considering it tasteless despite the humor. i like i though you''ll get a 5 from me :)</td>', 'i can''t immediately be sure, but is that a condom? interesting idea, but my guess is that others are considering it tasteless despite the humor. i like i though you''ll get a 5 from me :)', '2007-05-31 15:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719671, 519824, 63006, '<td valign="top">very cute tiny frog. i like that the leaf at the left hand side is in sharp focus as well, as it balances the photo :) maybe a different crop, making it more of  a widescreen style would have looked good, or at least that''s my idea. good shot :) 7</td>', 'very cute tiny frog. i like that the leaf at the left hand side is in sharp focus as well, as it balances the photo :) maybe a different crop, making it more of  a widescreen style would have looked good, or at least that''s my idea. good shot :) 7', '2007-05-31 15:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719677, 522628, 63006, '<td valign="top">you should rotate your seedlings, that way they won''t all grow crooked. good idea though, and don''t worry, mine all did the same thing this year. great focus on the dirt at the base of the seedling, although because of that, it looks like the upper leaves are not in focus quite as well. good job though, 5</td>', 'you should rotate your seedlings, that way they won''t all grow crooked. good idea though, and don''t worry, mine all did the same thing this year. great focus on the dirt at the base of the seedling, although because of that, it looks like the upper leaves are not in focus quite as well. good job though, 5', '2007-05-31 15:30:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719687, 523565, 63006, '<td valign="top">make sure not to inject that with all those bubbles. great focus, although the end of the needle almost looks doubled with how out of focus it is. very nice though, 6</td>', 'make sure not to inject that with all those bubbles. great focus, although the end of the needle almost looks doubled with how out of focus it is. very nice though, 6', '2007-05-31 15:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3719692, 522738, 63006, '<td valign="top">nice, but i can''t say i like the slants in the liquids. different levels, but it being level would have been better in my own opinion :) but it''s your shot, i''m just scoring and commenting. 6</td>', 'nice, but i can''t say i like the slants in the liquids. different levels, but it being level would have been better in my own opinion :) but it''s your shot, i''m just scoring and commenting. 6', '2007-05-31 15:34:17.000000', NULL, 1),
