(3720448, 520664, 72317, '<td valign="top">The color on the back of the fern in focus is unnaturally bright on the left side. However, the image title reflects on your intellect, and I really like this image overall. I love the way that the ferns fade into the darkness, and I like the detail on the fern in focus.<br/>Hrm.. Can''t decide between an eight and a nine.<br/>Nine it is.<br/>=P</td>', 'The color on the back of the fern in focus is unnaturally bright on the left side. However, the image title reflects on your intellect, and I really like this image overall. I love the way that the ferns fade into the darkness, and I like the detail on the fern in focus.Hrm.. Can''t decide between an eight and a nine.Nine it is.=P', '2007-05-31 19:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3720455, 522876, 72317, '<td valign="top">Not a fan of the wires, but to be blunt, the image is a bit plain and I can see why you included them considering the fact that the image itself has very little going on. I like that you can see the bird''s full tail and make out its individual feathers. I''m giving you a six; there''s not enough in the image to hold my attention, and I don''t like the color too much.</td>', 'Not a fan of the wires, but to be blunt, the image is a bit plain and I can see why you included them considering the fact that the image itself has very little going on. I like that you can see the bird''s full tail and make out its individual feathers. I''m giving you a six; there''s not enough in the image to hold my attention, and I don''t like the color too much.', '2007-05-31 19:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3720465, 524133, 72317, '<td valign="top">This is quite nice. I don''t like the random spots of blurriness or that the background looks like it''s giving off alot of light.. The hair on your model looks like it''s in a cloud. Also, the hand is really distracting. I feel like I should be focusing on his eye, but the hand distracts me. I don''t know that that could be avoided, however..<br/>Will an eight do for you?</td>', 'This is quite nice. I don''t like the random spots of blurriness or that the background looks like it''s giving off alot of light.. The hair on your model looks like it''s in a cloud. Also, the hand is really distracting. I feel like I should be focusing on his eye, but the hand distracts me. I don''t know that that could be avoided, however..Will an eight do for you?', '2007-05-31 19:40:52.000000', NULL, 1),
