(3721934, 523184, 74059, '<td valign="top">Fantastic!  My favorite so far.</td>', 'Fantastic!  My favorite so far.', '2007-06-01 01:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3722141, 524120, 37234, '<td valign="top">I really like the idea, but the actual photo is a bit too OOF for me to really figure out what I''m looking at.</td>', 'I really like the idea, but the actual photo is a bit too OOF for me to really figure out what I''m looking at.', '2007-06-01 02:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3722146, 524106, 37234, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept</td>', 'Interesting concept', '2007-06-01 02:27:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3722154, 523549, 37234, '<td valign="top">Wow! How did you do that, I''d like to know. Fascinating photo. Best in the bunch, IMHO</td>', 'Wow! How did you do that, I''d like to know. Fascinating photo. Best in the bunch, IMHO', '2007-06-01 02:29:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3722158, 521110, 37234, '<td valign="top">VERY nice capture</td>', 'VERY nice capture', '2007-06-01 02:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3722159, 523657, 62249, '<td valign="top">Good composition, creative, and well exposed. Needs to be sharper.</td>', 'Good composition, creative, and well exposed. Needs to be sharper.', '2007-06-01 02:29:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3722167, 523172, 37234, '<td valign="top">I would give this photo a higher score, but the grain distracts from the effect. Very good idea, though, and nicely framed.</td>', 'I would give this photo a higher score, but the grain distracts from the effect. Very good idea, though, and nicely framed.', '2007-06-01 02:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3722180, 523876, 37234, '<td valign="top">I think this photo would have been stunning if two things were different:<br/>(1) Smooth glass that doesn''t distort the water<br/>(2) Smooth backdrop (no vertical lines, like can be seen on the left half of the backdrop).</td>', 'I think this photo would have been stunning if two things were different:(1) Smooth glass that doesn''t distort the water(2) Smooth backdrop (no vertical lines, like can be seen on the left half of the backdrop).', '2007-06-01 02:33:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3722190, 523415, 62249, '<td valign="top">Needs more shadow and highlight detail.</td>', 'Needs more shadow and highlight detail.', '2007-06-01 02:35:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3722194, 522944, 37234, '<td valign="top">Good capture. I think a little brighter would be better.</td>', 'Good capture. I think a little brighter would be better.', '2007-06-01 02:36:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3722202, 521408, 37234, '<td valign="top">Just my opinion: Move the bottle (top left) OUT of the photo, and pan up and right slightly, to get more of the source bottle in the photo. After, some USM to sharpen the image a bit.</td>', 'Just my opinion: Move the bottle (top left) OUT of the photo, and pan up and right slightly, to get more of the source bottle in the photo. After, some USM to sharpen the image a bit.', '2007-06-01 02:38:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3722207, 521414, 37234, '<td valign="top">Great capture!</td>', 'Great capture!', '2007-06-01 02:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3722209, 523730, 39144, '<td valign="top">Very nice setup and creativity. I really like the idea behind this photograph. I love the stuff coming out of the bottles. My only complaints would be that it is a bit on the dark side, the DOF is a bit too limited, and the photo is a bit confusing with so many elements to look at.</td>', 'Very nice setup and creativity. I really like the idea behind this photograph. I love the stuff coming out of the bottles. My only complaints would be that it is a bit on the dark side, the DOF is a bit too limited, and the photo is a bit confusing with so many elements to look at.', '2007-06-01 02:39:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3722216, 523479, 62249, '<td valign="top">Clever concept and well executed.</td>', 'Clever concept and well executed.', '2007-06-01 02:40:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3722222, 521333, 39144, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot of an adorable little creature. I like how you seem to have taken the camera down low to get this shot. The DOF is just perfect, and the lack of harsh, contrasting shadows is nice. The overall photo does seem a bit on the soft side of focus though.</td>', 'This is a nice shot of an adorable little creature. I like how you seem to have taken the camera down low to get this shot. The DOF is just perfect, and the lack of harsh, contrasting shadows is nice. The overall photo does seem a bit on the soft side of focus though.', '2007-06-01 02:41:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3722229, 521866, 39144, '<td valign="top">I can only imagine how difficult this must have been to set up. I''d be interested to knew exactly what it is. Unfortunately, the focus seems a bit off, enough so that the subject is not easily recognizable.</td>', 'I can only imagine how difficult this must have been to set up. I''d be interested to knew exactly what it is. Unfortunately, the focus seems a bit off, enough so that the subject is not easily recognizable.', '2007-06-01 02:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3722231, 521651, 37234, '<td valign="top">Sorry to give you a low score, but the photo quality is very low. I don''t really get your "science" point either, but I''m assuming you have one and not lowering my scoring based on that.</td>', 'Sorry to give you a low score, but the photo quality is very low. I don''t really get your "science" point either, but I''m assuming you have one and not lowering my scoring based on that.', '2007-06-01 02:43:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3722238, 523990, 39144, '<td valign="top">What a perfect crop on this shot. This photo definitely proves that there is a place in photography for centered compositions. I love how the light skims across the grass, right to the little girl. I love how it lights up the trunk of the tree, making it glow against the dark, shady background. I just wish that it would have found it''s way to all of the leaves. That is the only improvement that could be made on this photo IMO.</td>', 'What a perfect crop on this shot. This photo definitely proves that there is a place in photography for centered compositions. I love how the light skims across the grass, right to the little girl. I love how it lights up the trunk of the tree, making it glow against the dark, shady background. I just wish that it would have found it''s way to all of the leaves. That is the only improvement that could be made on this photo IMO.', '2007-06-01 02:45:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3722246, 523429, 37234, '<td valign="top">Well, I have to admit, I don''t care for the photo at all. The quality is low, the light is very annoying, and it''s out of focus. Not trying to be "mean", just my honest opinion. On the other hand, if you were trying to make a humorous point, you did a great job. This really reminds me of a campy alien invasian flick.</td>', 'Well, I have to admit, I don''t care for the photo at all. The quality is low, the light is very annoying, and it''s out of focus. Not trying to be "mean", just my honest opinion. On the other hand, if you were trying to make a humorous point, you did a great job. This really reminds me of a campy alien invasian flick.', '2007-06-01 02:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3722248, 521456, 39144, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice concept. I''ve seen it done before. I really like the bulb in this photo, but it seems a bit small. I''m not sure why. The hand doesn''t really fit in well with the sky. The color of lighting is extremely different. Very apparent that either a) you took a picture of the hand in front of a print, or, more likely, a monitor, or b) you fooled around with it in PP. With that fixed, this would be a much better photograph. Without it, it still stands well against the composition in this challenge.</td>', 'This is a very nice concept. I''ve seen it done before. I really like the bulb in this photo, but it seems a bit small. I''m not sure why. The hand doesn''t really fit in well with the sky. The color of lighting is extremely different. Very apparent that either a) you took a picture of the hand in front of a print, or, more likely, a monitor, or b) you fooled around with it in PP. With that fixed, this would be a much better photograph. Without it, it still stands well against the composition in this challenge.', '2007-06-01 02:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3722253, 522738, 37234, '<td valign="top">Now that''s just cool. I know how you did it, from a technical perspective, but it doesn''t change the effect. It''s a fun photo to look at. Great job!</td>', 'Now that''s just cool. I know how you did it, from a technical perspective, but it doesn''t change the effect. It''s a fun photo to look at. Great job!', '2007-06-01 02:48:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3722266, 522887, 62249, '<td valign="top">Graininess doesn''t work well with subject matter, and photo doesn''t meet challenge topic very well.</td>', 'Graininess doesn''t work well with subject matter, and photo doesn''t meet challenge topic very well.', '2007-06-01 02:54:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3722276, 523150, 62249, '<td valign="top">Adjust the color cast.</td>', 'Adjust the color cast.', '2007-06-01 02:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3722292, 523504, 62249, '<td valign="top">Great! Love how the whiskers show up so distinctly.</td>', 'Great! Love how the whiskers show up so distinctly.', '2007-06-01 03:07:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3722296, 524206, 62249, '<td valign="top">Creative, well executed, and the model looks like a blond version of Data from Star Trek NG.</td>', 'Creative, well executed, and the model looks like a blond version of Data from Star Trek NG.', '2007-06-01 03:09:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3722414, 523846, 48954, '<td valign="top">wow!!! great shot</td>', 'wow!!! great shot', '2007-06-01 04:29:27.000000', NULL, 1),
