(3723448, 522825, 71958, '<td valign="top">cool idea, would like to see it straightened</td>', 'cool idea, would like to see it straightened', '2007-06-01 11:01:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3723502, 523690, 39144, '<td valign="top">I love the subject (glass with liquid and controlled lighting, not the playboy bunny). The placement of the glass in the frame seems a bit odd. It''s too close to the center, but not close enough at the same time. The glass and light, with their symmetrical qualities would look better in a centered composition. The other thing would make it look better off-center, but more than it is. Other than that, the coloring of the playboy bunny is kind of an ugly, muted grey. It would have been nicer to find something that contrasted more with the red light instead.</td>', 'I love the subject (glass with liquid and controlled lighting, not the playboy bunny). The placement of the glass in the frame seems a bit odd. It''s too close to the center, but not close enough at the same time. The glass and light, with their symmetrical qualities would look better in a centered composition. The other thing would make it look better off-center, but more than it is. Other than that, the coloring of the playboy bunny is kind of an ugly, muted grey. It would have been nicer to find something that contrasted more with the red light instead.', '2007-06-01 11:14:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3723521, 522710, 39144, '<td valign="top">I expected to see a lot of these in this challenge. This one seems similar in composition to the previous science challenge <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=42130" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/148/thumb/42130.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/148/thumb/42130.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/148/thumb/42130.jpg"/></a>. No doubt that was intended. I like the inclusion of more space in the other challenge entry. This shot is so close and quasi macro that it is hard to tell what it is at first and second glance. Still, a nice image though, with some decent work put in to it.</td>', 'I expected to see a lot of these in this challenge. This one seems similar in composition to the previous science challenge . No doubt that was intended. I like the inclusion of more space in the other challenge entry. This shot is so close and quasi macro that it is hard to tell what it is at first and second glance. Still, a nice image though, with some decent work put in to it.', '2007-06-01 11:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3723528, 523854, 39144, '<td valign="top">I have no idea what those are. (I''m a computer geek and photography geek, not a science geek) But this has got to be the best image I''ve viewed so far. Your symmetry is perfect for this challenge. The blurred-out background complements your subject perfectly. Nice work.</td>', 'I have no idea what those are. (I''m a computer geek and photography geek, not a science geek) But this has got to be the best image I''ve viewed so far. Your symmetry is perfect for this challenge. The blurred-out background complements your subject perfectly. Nice work.', '2007-06-01 11:21:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3723535, 522970, 39144, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of this snake. The square crop works well with your composition. I love how you got the tongue out and everything. I just wish the DOF was a bit deeper to get the rattles in focus also.</td>', 'Nice capture of this snake. The square crop works well with your composition. I love how you got the tongue out and everything. I just wish the DOF was a bit deeper to get the rattles in focus also.', '2007-06-01 11:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3723542, 523493, 39144, '<td valign="top">Nice motion panning image. I especially like the reflection of the motorcyle. The blurred red on the left is a bit of a destraction, and the fence in the background is too, but your subject is awesome.</td>', 'Nice motion panning image. I especially like the reflection of the motorcyle. The blurred red on the left is a bit of a destraction, and the fence in the background is too, but your subject is awesome.', '2007-06-01 11:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3723551, 524213, 39144, '<td valign="top">Your composition is good, with the use of the rule of thirds. The silhouette is a bit chunky though, and the lighting is a bit too plain for my taste.</td>', 'Your composition is good, with the use of the rule of thirds. The silhouette is a bit chunky though, and the lighting is a bit too plain for my taste.', '2007-06-01 11:25:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3723559, 523010, 39144, '<td valign="top">Excellent macro shot. The lighting is perfect for this subject, and the colors are perfectly saturated. Nice work. The DOF is a bit shallow, but not enough to make a huge difference.</td>', 'Excellent macro shot. The lighting is perfect for this subject, and the colors are perfectly saturated. Nice work. The DOF is a bit shallow, but not enough to make a huge difference.', '2007-06-01 11:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3723706, 521202, 78110, '<td valign="top">cool</td>', 'cool', '2007-06-01 11:49:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3723889, 519537, 52500, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but it got lost in the execution for me.  I don''t like the green and blue colors together, and I would like to see the whole dropper thing in nice sharp focus.  I do like the aperture choice to create little stars out of the points of light.</td>', 'I like the idea, but it got lost in the execution for me.  I don''t like the green and blue colors together, and I would like to see the whole dropper thing in nice sharp focus.  I do like the aperture choice to create little stars out of the points of light.', '2007-06-01 12:24:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3723890, 519225, 52500, '<td valign="top">This is a great capture, but it has too much of a blurry/painterly feel for my taste.</td>', 'This is a great capture, but it has too much of a blurry/painterly feel for my taste.', '2007-06-01 12:24:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3723894, 523548, 52500, '<td valign="top">I get the idea here, but I think it would help me a lot to know what that thing is that is being flamed, and I just can''t tell.  I have discovered that photographing fire and having it look cool is really hard.  My best advice is to use a small aperture and really fast shutter speed (like f/8, 1/200 or so) so as not to blow out the flame, and then light the rest of the stuff in the shot like crazy.</td>', 'I get the idea here, but I think it would help me a lot to know what that thing is that is being flamed, and I just can''t tell.  I have discovered that photographing fire and having it look cool is really hard.  My best advice is to use a small aperture and really fast shutter speed (like f/8, 1/200 or so) so as not to blow out the flame, and then light the rest of the stuff in the shot like crazy.', '2007-06-01 12:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3723898, 519720, 52500, '<td valign="top">I certainly see a lot of photon interactions, but the photo just doesn''t end up being appealing to my eye.  I''m not a fan of the brownish-yellow, and the glass thing looks very clunky (I don''t know how to describe what I mean by that very well...it''s like it''s almost in focus and then massively sharpened or something).</td>', 'I certainly see a lot of photon interactions, but the photo just doesn''t end up being appealing to my eye.  I''m not a fan of the brownish-yellow, and the glass thing looks very clunky (I don''t know how to describe what I mean by that very well...it''s like it''s almost in focus and then massively sharpened or something).', '2007-06-01 12:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3723935, 523623, 52500, '<td valign="top">I assume this is a legal double exposure of the same flower/vase in two different positions.  Great idea and very well executed.  Alas, I just don''t find it to be a very interesting photo to look at for very long.  Still, you get a 6 from me.</td>', 'I assume this is a legal double exposure of the same flower/vase in two different positions.  Great idea and very well executed.  Alas, I just don''t find it to be a very interesting photo to look at for very long.  Still, you get a 6 from me.', '2007-06-01 12:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3723942, 521408, 52500, '<td valign="top">Good idea.  I like the composition, color, and the reflective surface that everything is on, but it seems a bit flat.  Also, the whites have a pretty strong blue cast to them.  Perhaps a different white balance would have helped.  Still a 6 from me.</td>', 'Good idea.  I like the composition, color, and the reflective surface that everything is on, but it seems a bit flat.  Also, the whites have a pretty strong blue cast to them.  Perhaps a different white balance would have helped.  Still a 6 from me.', '2007-06-01 12:32:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3723956, 523678, 52500, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, I have no idea what is going on here.  This looks to me like a totally random shot in someone''s garage.  I''ve stared at this for a while, but I just can''t make it work.</td>', 'Unfortunately, I have no idea what is going on here.  This looks to me like a totally random shot in someone''s garage.  I''ve stared at this for a while, but I just can''t make it work.', '2007-06-01 12:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3723958, 520615, 52500, '<td valign="top">I''m not really sure what happened here, so I don''t think I can help you fix it next time, but I can at least tell you what I don''t like.  The colors of the branch and background are very muted, yet the bird is massively over saturated.  The shot is noisy.  Almost all detail in the bird is lost for some reason, and nothing appears to be very sharp.</td>', 'I''m not really sure what happened here, so I don''t think I can help you fix it next time, but I can at least tell you what I don''t like.  The colors of the branch and background are very muted, yet the bird is massively over saturated.  The shot is noisy.  Almost all detail in the bird is lost for some reason, and nothing appears to be very sharp.', '2007-06-01 12:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3723974, 523902, 63360, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea.  I would like to see some of the individual components more clearly, as it''s a little hard to see the details.  Perhaps increasing the brightness/contrast and cropping the top would improve this.</td>', 'Interesting idea.  I would like to see some of the individual components more clearly, as it''s a little hard to see the details.  Perhaps increasing the brightness/contrast and cropping the top would improve this.', '2007-06-01 12:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3723995, 522452, 63360, '<td valign="top">I like your idea.  How about shooting this from a lower perspective?  This would give the illusion that these are taller.  I would also play with the colors a bit (maybe even completely desaturated) to give it more of a menacing appearance.</td>', 'I like your idea.  How about shooting this from a lower perspective?  This would give the illusion that these are taller.  I would also play with the colors a bit (maybe even completely desaturated) to give it more of a menacing appearance.', '2007-06-01 12:43:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3723998, 521033, 63360, '<td valign="top">Beautiful venation.  Maybe clone out the brown spots, as they distract a bit.</td>', 'Beautiful venation.  Maybe clone out the brown spots, as they distract a bit.', '2007-06-01 12:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3724002, 520911, 63360, '<td valign="top">Nicely done!  I really like the DOF.</td>', 'Nicely done!  I really like the DOF.', '2007-06-01 12:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3724011, 521866, 63360, '<td valign="top">Is this an ice cube with burning alcohol?  Really difficult to tell.  Possibly adjusting your white balance would improve this.  I think using a more symmetrical cube would look very cool.</td>', 'Is this an ice cube with burning alcohol?  Really difficult to tell.  Possibly adjusting your white balance would improve this.  I think using a more symmetrical cube would look very cool.', '2007-06-01 12:47:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3724017, 519720, 63360, '<td valign="top">The texture and lines are interesting.  Could probably improve this with more contrast to bring out more details.</td>', 'The texture and lines are interesting.  Could probably improve this with more contrast to bring out more details.', '2007-06-01 12:49:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3724020, 523512, 63360, '<td valign="top">Nice work!  Love the colors in this and your bg is quite interesting.</td>', 'Nice work!  Love the colors in this and your bg is quite interesting.', '2007-06-01 12:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3724029, 524214, 63360, '<td valign="top">Good idea!  To improve this (IMO):  use a more uniform bg and get closer to your subject as I think that the glare on the glass distracts.</td>', 'Good idea!  To improve this (IMO):  use a more uniform bg and get closer to your subject as I think that the glare on the glass distracts.', '2007-06-01 12:54:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3724042, 523766, 63360, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand your title.  Anyway, I like the texture and colors of this fossi but it appears to be suspended in mid-air.  Perhaps use a bg that would help anchor this.</td>', 'I don''t understand your title.  Anyway, I like the texture and colors of this fossi but it appears to be suspended in mid-air.  Perhaps use a bg that would help anchor this.', '2007-06-01 12:58:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3724065, 522586, 63360, '<td valign="top">I like the way the light strikes the scalpel, but probably needs more of it.  The forceps almost blend into the bg, so are probably more of a distraction.  A tighter shot would have more impact.</td>', 'I like the way the light strikes the scalpel, but probably needs more of it.  The forceps almost blend into the bg, so are probably more of a distraction.  A tighter shot would have more impact.', '2007-06-01 13:04:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3724072, 520072, 63360, '<td valign="top">I like your idea. IMO, I think that this would have more impact if you cropped out most of the left and right sides and some of the bottom, and used a totally black bg.</td>', 'I like your idea. IMO, I think that this would have more impact if you cropped out most of the left and right sides and some of the bottom, and used a totally black bg.', '2007-06-01 13:07:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3724079, 523709, 63360, '<td valign="top">I find your scale to be visually interesting, but what is that green stuff?  This would be better if the bg wasn''t as bright and maybe a more interesting subject on the scale.</td>', 'I find your scale to be visually interesting, but what is that green stuff?  This would be better if the bg wasn''t as bright and maybe a more interesting subject on the scale.', '2007-06-01 13:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
