(3724195, 523418, 63360, '<td valign="top">I like how you included the trees in the foreground.  These wind generators are quite impressive. They would really stand out more with a deeper blue in the sky.  A company is trying to put a large windfarm in Kansas right outside of my town, so I may have a view like this in the near future. :)</td>', 'I like how you included the trees in the foreground.  These wind generators are quite impressive. They would really stand out more with a deeper blue in the sky.  A company is trying to put a large windfarm in Kansas right outside of my town, so I may have a view like this in the near future. :)', '2007-06-01 13:47:58.000000', NULL, 1),
