(3724678, 524061, 48697, '<td valign="top">nice detail and lighting!</td>', 'nice detail and lighting!', '2007-06-01 15:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3724686, 523416, 48697, '<td valign="top">cool photo but the sky is a bit distracting</td>', 'cool photo but the sky is a bit distracting', '2007-06-01 15:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3724694, 523896, 48697, '<td valign="top">nice detail.</td>', 'nice detail.', '2007-06-01 15:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3724702, 521683, 48697, '<td valign="top">Looks a bit OOF.</td>', 'Looks a bit OOF.', '2007-06-01 15:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3724715, 523027, 48697, '<td valign="top">I would love to shoot that gun! great capture of the grass flying from the recoil of that monster!</td>', 'I would love to shoot that gun! great capture of the grass flying from the recoil of that monster!', '2007-06-01 15:52:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3724727, 522951, 48697, '<td valign="top">Cool photo! looks like he is making faces.</td>', 'Cool photo! looks like he is making faces.', '2007-06-01 15:54:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3724743, 522887, 48697, '<td valign="top">Seems OOF and very grainey. The horizon is also a bit slanted that distracts imo.</td>', 'Seems OOF and very grainey. The horizon is also a bit slanted that distracts imo.', '2007-06-01 15:58:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3725014, 522664, 39144, '<td valign="top">The composition in this is nice, as well as the limited DOF. The entire image lacks the detail that you would expect from a macro shot. It almost looks as if it was neat imaged quite a bit.</td>', 'The composition in this is nice, as well as the limited DOF. The entire image lacks the detail that you would expect from a macro shot. It almost looks as if it was neat imaged quite a bit.', '2007-06-01 17:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3725021, 520306, 39144, '<td valign="top">I''m sure this was very interesting, seeing the whole flight simulator thing. The image as a contest entry, however, is not up to par. It gives off more of a snapshot feel, than a contest entry.</td>', 'I''m sure this was very interesting, seeing the whole flight simulator thing. The image as a contest entry, however, is not up to par. It gives off more of a snapshot feel, than a contest entry.', '2007-06-01 17:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3725047, 524061, 39144, '<td valign="top">Great composition and lighting. Very good use of rule of thirds also. And I really think the color choice makes this photo stand out from the others. Excellent work.</td>', 'Great composition and lighting. Very good use of rule of thirds also. And I really think the color choice makes this photo stand out from the others. Excellent work.', '2007-06-01 17:21:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3725057, 524120, 39144, '<td valign="top">There is no detail in this image. It is not obvious as to what you are photographing, and not abstract enough to be considered abstract art. It just appears to be a blur or colors.</td>', 'There is no detail in this image. It is not obvious as to what you are photographing, and not abstract enough to be considered abstract art. It just appears to be a blur or colors.', '2007-06-01 17:22:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3725064, 524126, 39144, '<td valign="top">Great expression. I just with the DOF was not so limited.</td>', 'Great expression. I just with the DOF was not so limited.', '2007-06-01 17:23:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3725079, 522951, 39144, '<td valign="top">Nice image. I like shots that look like the lens is half way under water. I think it is more effective when you can see sky or something above the water too though. The colors seem a bit muted, like a curves or levels adjustment was needed. Detail and sharpness are good.</td>', 'Nice image. I like shots that look like the lens is half way under water. I think it is more effective when you can see sky or something above the water too though. The colors seem a bit muted, like a curves or levels adjustment was needed. Detail and sharpness are good.', '2007-06-01 17:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3725092, 520460, 39144, '<td valign="top">This is exactly the type of shot I expected to see in this challenge, and you accomplished it very well. Nice work. The limited DOF works perfect on this image.</td>', 'This is exactly the type of shot I expected to see in this challenge, and you accomplished it very well. Nice work. The limited DOF works perfect on this image.', '2007-06-01 17:27:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3725101, 524153, 39144, '<td valign="top">This is a nice idea, but the lights look like they were poorly printed, and your subject is still a bit too dark. It just needs more light in front, set up to get the low key effect.</td>', 'This is a nice idea, but the lights look like they were poorly printed, and your subject is still a bit too dark. It just needs more light in front, set up to get the low key effect.', '2007-06-01 17:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3725107, 524150, 39144, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and composition. The lighting is good to minimize reflections, but it appears just a tad bit too dark. Other than that, this is an excellent image.</td>', 'Nice idea and composition. The lighting is good to minimize reflections, but it appears just a tad bit too dark. Other than that, this is an excellent image.', '2007-06-01 17:29:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3725116, 523303, 39144, '<td valign="top">Great limited DOF to isolate the lady bugs and the background. However, the closer petals, or whatever they are, are a bit distracting. The lighting is great, and the color/saturation is perfect.</td>', 'Great limited DOF to isolate the lady bugs and the background. However, the closer petals, or whatever they are, are a bit distracting. The lighting is great, and the color/saturation is perfect.', '2007-06-01 17:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3725122, 524034, 39144, '<td valign="top">What a great image. Perfect lighting, perfect composition, perfect subject, and perfect processing.</td>', 'What a great image. Perfect lighting, perfect composition, perfect subject, and perfect processing.', '2007-06-01 17:31:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3725126, 523181, 39144, '<td valign="top">Ooooh. Awesome. Definitely a top image in this challenge. Nice work. I would hope you do a tutorial on this after the challenge is over.</td>', 'Ooooh. Awesome. Definitely a top image in this challenge. Nice work. I would hope you do a tutorial on this after the challenge is over.', '2007-06-01 17:32:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3725348, 523746, 24550, '<td valign="top">great clarity, but i dont understand the streak. i guess its just supposed to be ''magical''. 7</td>', 'great clarity, but i dont understand the streak. i guess its just supposed to be ''magical''. 7', '2007-06-01 18:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3725350, 523181, 24550, '<td valign="top">very cool. a similar image popped up a few votes back and i mentioned it would be better without image grain.t his is what i had in mind. 8</td>', 'very cool. a similar image popped up a few votes back and i mentioned it would be better without image grain.t his is what i had in mind. 8', '2007-06-01 18:02:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3725353, 521866, 75781, '<td valign="top">very cool, I like it.  I really like abstract photography, but I think its often very underrated here at DPC.  Kudo''s for doing something different than the norm!</td>', 'very cool, I like it.  I really like abstract photography, but I think its often very underrated here at DPC.  Kudo''s for doing something different than the norm!', '2007-06-01 18:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3725354, 524200, 24550, '<td valign="top">good clear picture but the plasma balls are getting a bit old. 7</td>', 'good clear picture but the plasma balls are getting a bit old. 7', '2007-06-01 18:02:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3725357, 524061, 24550, '<td valign="top">love the colors and depth of field. i can almost feel the texture on the little critter. 9.</td>', 'love the colors and depth of field. i can almost feel the texture on the little critter. 9.', '2007-06-01 18:03:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3725360, 523504, 24550, '<td valign="top">fantastic and hillarious. 9.</td>', 'fantastic and hillarious. 9.', '2007-06-01 18:03:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3725364, 523869, 24550, '<td valign="top">looks good in black and white.</td>', 'looks good in black and white.', '2007-06-01 18:03:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3725366, 524030, 24550, '<td valign="top">haha well done. made me smile. 9.</td>', 'haha well done. made me smile. 9.', '2007-06-01 18:03:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3725372, 522951, 24550, '<td valign="top">interesting to see a cat underwater. 6.</td>', 'interesting to see a cat underwater. 6.', '2007-06-01 18:04:32.000000', NULL, 1),
