(3725798, 523315, 66778, '<td valign="top">The VLA is a miraculous place. I like the saturation work you did on the photo. Maybe if the dish was turned more it would be better. I like how you framed the second one in the background. The dish in the foreground, though, is a lttle too dark, and thust loses a little of its edge as the focus of the photo.</td>', 'The VLA is a miraculous place. I like the saturation work you did on the photo. Maybe if the dish was turned more it would be better. I like how you framed the second one in the background. The dish in the foreground, though, is a lttle too dark, and thust loses a little of its edge as the focus of the photo.', '2007-06-01 19:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3725813, 523214, 66778, '<td valign="top">Very creative use of a sparkler. The photo is powerful because of its subject''s simplicity.</td>', 'Very creative use of a sparkler. The photo is powerful because of its subject''s simplicity.', '2007-06-01 19:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3725821, 524209, 9906, '<td valign="top">If this was only bigger...<br/>TC</td>', 'If this was only bigger...TC', '2007-06-01 19:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
