(3728623, 523623, 63360, '<td valign="top">Love the wavy lines of the container against the black bg.  Ligting is good.  Maybe the flower petals need to be a bit punchier in color/clarity.</td>', 'Love the wavy lines of the container against the black bg.  Ligting is good.  Maybe the flower petals need to be a bit punchier in color/clarity.', '2007-06-02 12:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3728632, 523655, 63360, '<td valign="top">I''m having trouble understanding what this is - some kind of solar panels?  The overcast sky is visually interesting.  Maybe not enough contrast between sky and structure.</td>', 'I''m having trouble understanding what this is - some kind of solar panels?  The overcast sky is visually interesting.  Maybe not enough contrast between sky and structure.', '2007-06-02 12:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
