(3728641, 523876, 63360, '<td valign="top">Shouldn''t red and blue make purple?  :)  I like the movement created with the streams of liquid.  The textures in the glass distract; maybe use a container with a simpler shape.</td>', 'Shouldn''t red and blue make purple?  :)  I like the movement created with the streams of liquid.  The textures in the glass distract; maybe use a container with a simpler shape.', '2007-06-02 12:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
