(3734486, 524209, 60047, '<td valign="top">This is fun! I like the Apollo reference juxtaposed with the sepia and tin cans with string. Great concept and execution.</td>', 'This is fun! I like the Apollo reference juxtaposed with the sepia and tin cans with string. Great concept and execution.', '2007-06-04 00:21:56.000000', NULL, 1),
