(3734495, 524058, 60047, '<td valign="top">If I didn''t have the anchor on the bottom left, I wouldn''t appreciate the rest of what I am seeing. I love the color blue in this shot.</td>', 'If I didn''t have the anchor on the bottom left, I wouldn''t appreciate the rest of what I am seeing. I love the color blue in this shot.', '2007-06-04 00:22:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3734514, 523816, 60047, '<td valign="top">Simple and illustrative. Great concept. The bubbles are a little distracting from the message, here. I think if you use boiled and cooled water, the bubbles are eliminated.</td>', 'Simple and illustrative. Great concept. The bubbles are a little distracting from the message, here. I think if you use boiled and cooled water, the bubbles are eliminated.', '2007-06-04 00:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3734516, 524158, 63360, '<td valign="top">Good idea!  This could be in a microbiology textbook!  I like the vibrancy of colors.  To improve this, I think that the bacterial colony to the left of the inoculating loop should be in sharp focus, as my eye is drawn there.</td>', 'Good idea!  This could be in a microbiology textbook!  I like the vibrancy of colors.  To improve this, I think that the bacterial colony to the left of the inoculating loop should be in sharp focus, as my eye is drawn there.', '2007-06-04 00:25:34.000000', NULL, 1),
