(3734748, 519927, 60047, '<td valign="top">The right side of the camera needs to be rotated toward the subject just a bit more to get rid of the blur in the right third of this shot and increase the DOF on the subject that really matters to the viewer - the test tubes.</td>', 'The right side of the camera needs to be rotated toward the subject just a bit more to get rid of the blur in the right third of this shot and increase the DOF on the subject that really matters to the viewer - the test tubes.', '2007-06-04 00:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
