(3744335, 523932, 52130, '<td valign="top">lol :D</td>', 'lol :D', '2007-06-06 00:24:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3744340, 524013, 52130, '<td valign="top">cool, i don''t know exactly what I''m looking at, but I can tell it''s cool :)<br/>make sure you write a description please</td>', 'cool, i don''t know exactly what I''m looking at, but I can tell it''s cool :)make sure you write a description please', '2007-06-06 00:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3744346, 522520, 22734, '<td valign="top">Great fork in the sky! 7 on first pass and what a capture.</td>', 'Great fork in the sky! 7 on first pass and what a capture.', '2007-06-06 00:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3744351, 520119, 52130, '<td valign="top">lol, what??</td>', 'lol, what??', '2007-06-06 00:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3744363, 521202, 52130, '<td valign="top">oooohhh, ahhhhh</td>', 'oooohhh, ahhhhh', '2007-06-06 00:28:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3744374, 523932, 22734, '<td valign="top">Lol. A rip of an image. 7 on first pass.</td>', 'Lol. A rip of an image. 7 on first pass.', '2007-06-06 00:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3744385, 523463, 52130, '<td valign="top">i &lt;3 cuttlefish<br/>I was snorkling in bermuda and suddenly notice something a few inches from my goggles, so I backed up and there was a whole line of baby cuttlefish about 3 inches long. I looked around and soon saw the mom, I tried to get closer, but they swim faster than you would think! great shot!</td>', 'i <3 cuttlefishI was snorkling in bermuda and suddenly notice something a few inches from my goggles, so I backed up and there was a whole line of baby cuttlefish about 3 inches long. I looked around and soon saw the mom, I tried to get closer, but they swim faster than you would think! great shot!', '2007-06-06 00:32:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3744386, 524139, 39057, '<td valign="top">Sweet...yummy...</td>', 'Sweet...yummy...', '2007-06-06 00:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3744401, 521105, 22734, '<td valign="top">Wow! Impressive! 7 on first pass.</td>', 'Wow! Impressive! 7 on first pass.', '2007-06-06 00:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3744415, 522951, 22734, '<td valign="top">Impressive! Bump,</td>', 'Impressive! Bump,', '2007-06-06 00:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3744417, 523869, 22734, '<td valign="top">Entrancing capture and composition. 7 on first pass. Bump.</td>', 'Entrancing capture and composition. 7 on first pass. Bump.', '2007-06-06 00:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3744422, 523549, 22734, '<td valign="top">I taste them! 7 on first pass. Bump for ultra good workmanship!</td>', 'I taste them! 7 on first pass. Bump for ultra good workmanship!', '2007-06-06 00:39:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3744460, 523184, 52500, '<td valign="top">That''s super cool.  Rather than photographing a science related subject you made the photo itself (and its creation) the experiment!  Unexpected or not, good job entering this.</td>', 'That''s super cool.  Rather than photographing a science related subject you made the photo itself (and its creation) the experiment!  Unexpected or not, good job entering this.', '2007-06-06 00:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3744462, 523990, 52500, '<td valign="top">Fantastic.  Whatever that little one is actually doing, this photo really captures the look of true scientific interest in the tree.  Oh and the whole thing just looks cool, too.</td>', 'Fantastic.  Whatever that little one is actually doing, this photo really captures the look of true scientific interest in the tree.  Oh and the whole thing just looks cool, too.', '2007-06-06 00:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3744463, 524030, 52500, '<td valign="top">Fantastic idea.  I bet it took quite a bit of work to make that!  Lots of points for you for a great idea, execution, and final product (both the corn and the photo).</td>', 'Fantastic idea.  I bet it took quite a bit of work to make that!  Lots of points for you for a great idea, execution, and final product (both the corn and the photo).', '2007-06-06 00:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3744472, 523315, 52500, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Great dynamic range.  I like the little dish way far away in the background.  This looks like the VLA, but I haven''t been there in a long time.</td>', 'Nice shot.  Great dynamic range.  I like the little dish way far away in the background.  This looks like the VLA, but I haven''t been there in a long time.', '2007-06-06 00:48:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3744473, 521866, 52500, '<td valign="top">I really don''t have any idea what is going on here.  Not that that matters to me!  I love a good abstract.  I imagine you are getting some crappy scores from all of those abstract haters out there, and I''m sorry about that.  I''ll counteract them a little. :)</td>', 'I really don''t have any idea what is going on here.  Not that that matters to me!  I love a good abstract.  I imagine you are getting some crappy scores from all of those abstract haters out there, and I''m sorry about that.  I''ll counteract them a little. :)', '2007-06-06 00:48:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3744476, 524143, 52500, '<td valign="top">...and I like the simplicity of this shot.  I wonder, though, if it might have been nice to have a pipette or something similar lying on the table in the lower left.  I guess it feels like there is just a bit too much negative space, and that would break it up a little.  Still, quite lovely.</td>', '...and I like the simplicity of this shot.  I wonder, though, if it might have been nice to have a pipette or something similar lying on the table in the lower left.  I guess it feels like there is just a bit too much negative space, and that would break it up a little.  Still, quite lovely.', '2007-06-06 00:48:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3744480, 523504, 52500, '<td valign="top">This is great.  That''s a cute little guy!  He really looks like he''s just having a great ol'' time hanging out in that beaker (sorry, couldn''t help the bad pun).  Excellent color and DOF.  I pattern of the green background may be just a bit too much for my eyes to handle for very long.</td>', 'This is great.  That''s a cute little guy!  He really looks like he''s just having a great ol'' time hanging out in that beaker (sorry, couldn''t help the bad pun).  Excellent color and DOF.  I pattern of the green background may be just a bit too much for my eyes to handle for very long.', '2007-06-06 00:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3744483, 524066, 52500, '<td valign="top">Interesting!  I was trying to figure out what it was before I saw the title, so it is indeed unidentified.  Ah, science, the quest for knowledge.  Whatever it is, it looks really cool.  Nice job.</td>', 'Interesting!  I was trying to figure out what it was before I saw the title, so it is indeed unidentified.  Ah, science, the quest for knowledge.  Whatever it is, it looks really cool.  Nice job.', '2007-06-06 00:49:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3744515, 523549, 75993, '<td valign="top">I wonder what this would taste like? Cool idea 10/10 (creative)</td>', 'I wonder what this would taste like? Cool idea 10/10 (creative)', '2007-06-06 00:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3744518, 522951, 52500, '<td valign="top">This is a really amazing capture.  It''s not easy shooting an underwater subject through glass, much less a big ol'' kitty.  Nice and sharp, too.  I can''t decide whether I like the inclusion of the water line or not.  The whole thing seems pretty dark as well.</td>', 'This is a really amazing capture.  It''s not easy shooting an underwater subject through glass, much less a big ol'' kitty.  Nice and sharp, too.  I can''t decide whether I like the inclusion of the water line or not.  The whole thing seems pretty dark as well.', '2007-06-06 00:57:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3744548, 524030, 43410, '<td valign="top">are you serious???  lol, you the man.  can you say outside the box...<br/> <br/>you never cease to amaze me :)  great job as always</td>', 'are you serious???  lol, you the man.  can you say outside the box... you never cease to amaze me :)  great job as always', '2007-06-06 01:03:38.000000', NULL, 0),
