(3746237, 523577, 4226, '<td valign="top">Hey! thanks for your comment and I was looking for this shot after the voting is over.<br/>You need a tighter crop and also as I said in my last pic, if you could make align the clip perpendicular to the lines, it gives more shapes.</td>', 'Hey! thanks for your comment and I was looking for this shot after the voting is over.You need a tighter crop and also as I said in my last pic, if you could make align the clip perpendicular to the lines, it gives more shapes.', '2007-06-06 10:14:51.000000', NULL, 0),
