(3746589, 522970, 43073, '<td valign="top">Brilliant shot &amp; congrats on your new 4th best shot; it''s a good (if a bit scary) one to have on your profile page. As for those who want the rattle in focus, not me, I want to keep my eye on that mouth! That''s the business end, anyway, other end is all bluster!</td>', 'Brilliant shot & congrats on your new 4th best shot; it''s a good (if a bit scary) one to have on your profile page. As for those who want the rattle in focus, not me, I want to keep my eye on that mouth! That''s the business end, anyway, other end is all bluster!', '2007-06-06 11:51:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(3746591, 522886, 24454, '<td valign="top">Hey, Sam!  You TOTALLY ROCK!   This is not a bad finish for your very first challenge!  I am impressed!   I predict great things for you on dpChallenge!   You are going to give me, your mom and Aunt Theresa a run for our money for sure!  :)<br/> <br/>Awesome photo!</td>', 'Hey, Sam!  You TOTALLY ROCK!   This is not a bad finish for your very first challenge!  I am impressed!   I predict great things for you on dpChallenge!   You are going to give me, your mom and Aunt Theresa a run for our money for sure!  :) Awesome photo!', '2007-06-06 11:52:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(3746599, 521110, 24454, '<td valign="top">Peter!!!   WOW!!!   This is freaking AWESOME!  I want it to have a ribbon under it!   But congratulations on an honorable mention.  It could not be a more flawless, appealing macro.   And to catch the bee in flight like that.  Having spent hours hunched over flowers for a shot like this (to no avail), I appreciate how difficult it is to do!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Peter!!!   WOW!!!   This is freaking AWESOME!  I want it to have a ribbon under it!   But congratulations on an honorable mention.  It could not be a more flawless, appealing macro.   And to catch the bee in flight like that.  Having spent hours hunched over flowers for a shot like this (to no avail), I appreciate how difficult it is to do! ', '2007-06-06 11:55:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(3746612, 519937, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oooooh. . .I think this is awesome!   As clean and sharp as it could possibly be and excellent for the challenge.  Fantastic job!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Oooooh. . .I think this is awesome!   As clean and sharp as it could possibly be and excellent for the challenge.  Fantastic job! ', '2007-06-06 11:58:08.000000', NULL, 0),
