(3746692, 522474, 35004, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by scalvert:</b></div><hr/><i> I''m amazed this didn''t make the front page. It was my top pick with a 10. Nice work! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>ah thanks. I''m really happy though, getting this high on more-or-less my first go.</td>', 'Originally posted by scalvert: I''m amazed this didn''t make the front page. It was my top pick with a 10. Nice work!   ah thanks. I''m really happy though, getting this high on more-or-less my first go.', '2007-06-06 12:23:15.000000', NULL, 0),
