(3747632, 522872, 51538, '<td valign="top">Bird funnels.  I would not mind sharing a nature walk with you.  Though, of course, sharing the sights and sounds of an early morning hike with my daughters is a wonder within itself..</td>', 'Bird funnels.  I would not mind sharing a nature walk with you.  Though, of course, sharing the sights and sounds of an early morning hike with my daughters is a wonder within itself..', '2007-06-06 15:51:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(3747703, 522872, 65438, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot and a very nice finish.</td>', 'Fantastic shot and a very nice finish.', '2007-06-06 16:07:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(3747845, 524161, 67697, '<td valign="top">Whiterooks comment cracks me up.  We shall now pause and think for a moment...<br/> <br/>I like the background because it helps the red to stand out.  One thing I am now learning with my camera has to do with the f-stop.  I think a bigger number would increase the area of focus.  Please do keep running with your ideas and if you get a chance, show them to others before you get ready to enter the challenge. That might help you feel better as you watch your pictures get scoredon.  But do not let the voters define who you are as an artist - do what you like, and keep focusing on what you like, so you can be the best at it.</td>', 'Whiterooks comment cracks me up.  We shall now pause and think for a moment... I like the background because it helps the red to stand out.  One thing I am now learning with my camera has to do with the f-stop.  I think a bigger number would increase the area of focus.  Please do keep running with your ideas and if you get a chance, show them to others before you get ready to enter the challenge. That might help you feel better as you watch your pictures get scoredon.  But do not let the voters define who you are as an artist - do what you like, and keep focusing on what you like, so you can be the best at it.', '2007-06-06 16:35:28.000000', NULL, 0),
