(3747940, 522004, 30982, '<td valign="top">Bob, I have nothing to offer as to why this scored what it did.  To me it''s an absolutely delightful picture and very much in line with the challenge.  Heh.  Pun not really intended there, with the "in line" bit.  Really adorable!</td>', 'Bob, I have nothing to offer as to why this scored what it did.  To me it''s an absolutely delightful picture and very much in line with the challenge.  Heh.  Pun not really intended there, with the "in line" bit.  Really adorable!', '2007-06-06 16:49:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(3747952, 523596, 30982, '<td valign="top">Cute little thing!  Is he holding his mother''s hand?  Very good light, good contrast.  I think the only thing that hurt you here is the background, which is a common problem with zoos.  You''d think they''d set stuff up nicer for photographers, wouldn''t you?  :-)</td>', 'Cute little thing!  Is he holding his mother''s hand?  Very good light, good contrast.  I think the only thing that hurt you here is the background, which is a common problem with zoos.  You''d think they''d set stuff up nicer for photographers, wouldn''t you?  :-)', '2007-06-06 16:51:22.000000', NULL, 0),
