(3747983, 522970, 30982, '<td valign="top">OK, so the first thing I checked was what lens you used to shoot this guy.  Great detail and a very good shot of a rattlesnake - looks to be fairly mature as he''s got a pretty thick body.  Next thing - what did you do after you shot him??  And congrats on the new top row entry!!</td>', 'OK, so the first thing I checked was what lens you used to shoot this guy.  Great detail and a very good shot of a rattlesnake - looks to be fairly mature as he''s got a pretty thick body.  Next thing - what did you do after you shot him??  And congrats on the new top row entry!!', '2007-06-06 16:57:06.000000', NULL, 0),
