(3748133, 524030, 37961, '<td valign="top">You are just unstoppable. But I know how much hard work you put into your entries....amazing. I particularly love this one because I can relate to your message of engineering corn for fuels. The wires are an especially nice touch. <br/> <br/>Wow.</td>', 'You are just unstoppable. But I know how much hard work you put into your entries....amazing. I particularly love this one because I can relate to your message of engineering corn for fuels. The wires are an especially nice touch.  Wow.', '2007-06-06 17:16:37.000000', NULL, 0),
