(3754600, 523262, 34938, '<td valign="top">There seems to be a great degree of fringing on this. Also, not sure how this met the science challenge in the true sense of the word. Without your title, this is a bird image. The exposure and contrast are also poor...hope that helps you understand why it got voted low</td>', 'There seems to be a great degree of fringing on this. Also, not sure how this met the science challenge in the true sense of the word. Without your title, this is a bird image. The exposure and contrast are also poor...hope that helps you understand why it got voted low', '2007-06-07 23:08:07.000000', NULL, 0),
